# Reference trees

These directories are **local-only** (root `.gitignore`) and must never be pushed or shipped via Amplify:

`Earnings_tracker/`, `Factsheet-Automation/`, `Linker/`, `investor-portal-backend/`, `investor-portal-mobile/`, `phoenician-intelligence/`, `phoenician-intelligence-backend/`, `phoenician-intelligence-frontend/`, `phoenician-mail-sender/`, `phoenician-portfolio/`, `capiq-screen-agent/`

Use them to deepen understanding; persist durable insights into `.cursor/projects/<name>/` instead of relying on chat memory.
